// IntroString :
"P3500068157" "The Clockwork are using the cover of night to scavenge parts for more mechanical monstrosities. With every support beam and street lamp they take, they put our citizens in grave peril. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We need to cull the numbers of the Clockwork menace.</A> If we let them keep scavenging, I'm sure we'll soon be faced with a deadly accident."
